IMPLEMENT PHASE — round 1.

Todo {{ node.survey.fields.todoId }}. Work only in `{{ node.constrain.fields.worktree }}` on branch `{{ node.constrain.fields.branch }}` from base `{{ node.constrain.fields.baseHead }}`. Follow `{{ node.constrain.fields.planPath }}`.

